title: India Macro War Room — RBI DBIE dataset and dashboard
message: If you use this dataset or dashboard in research or a product, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Mohan
    given-names: Mayank
    alias: mayankmohan1992
repository-code: https://github.com/mayankmohan1992/india-macro-war-room
license: MIT
keywords:
  - macroeconomics
  - india
  - reserve-bank-of-india
  - monetary-policy
  - open-data
abstract: >-
  A daily-refreshed dataset, static JSON/CSV API and dashboard for 38 widely-watched Indian
  macroeconomic indicators, compiled from the Reserve Bank of India's public Database on Indian
  Economy (DBIE) publications, with every derived figure computed in an auditable build step.
